{"_id":"697d3e3f19b7a824528a4655","nodeId":"Xs9gIVdO9TuZabUapgubJ","roadmapSlug":"ruby-on-rails","createdAt":"2026-01-30T23:26:55.240Z","description":"# RSpec\n\nRSpec is a testing framework for Ruby. It provides a domain-specific language (DSL) for writing tests that are easy to read and understand. RSpec focuses on behavior-driven development (BDD), allowing developers to describe the desired behavior of their code in a clear and concise manner, leading to more maintainable and reliable applications.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"RSpec","url":"https://rspec.info/","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a25f"},{"type":"opensource","title":"rspec-rails","url":"https://github.com/rspec/rspec-rails","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a260"},{"type":"article","title":"Ruby on Rails Testing with RSpec: Writing your First Tests","url":"https://medium.com/nerd-for-tech/ruby-on-rails-testing-with-rspec-writing-your-first-tests-6330920928fd","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a261"},{"type":"article","title":"Getting Started With Testing In Rails (Using Minitest and RSpec)","url":"https://medium.com/@ethanryan/getting-started-with-testing-in-rails-using-minitest-and-rspec-113fe1f866a","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a262"},{"type":"article","title":"Minitest vs. RSpec in Rails","url":"https://www.honeybadger.io/blog/minitest-rspec-rails/","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a263"},{"type":"video","title":"Automated testing with rspec","url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLS6F722u-R6Ik3fbeLXbSclWkT6Qsp9ng","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a264"},{"type":"video","title":"Test Driven RSpec","url":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLr442xinba86s9cCWxoIH_xq5UE9Wwo4Z","_id":"697d3e3f5c049b276520a265"}],"updatedAt":"2026-01-30T23:26:55.240Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/ruby-on-rails/content/Xs9gIVdO9TuZabUapgubJ.md"}